# Product terminology

Use these names in **all user-facing** copy (app strings, Play Store, website, marketing, emails). Do **not** use the old terms.

## Finnish

| Use | Do not use |
|-----|------------|
| **Sadetutka** | Myrskytutka, ukkostutka, tutka (when meaning precipitation radar tab) |
| **Merisää** | Meriteksti, meritekstiyhteenveto, meritekstit |

Lightning stays **salamat** / **salama**.

## English

| Use | Do not use |
|-----|------------|
| **Rain radar** | Storm radar |
| **Marine weather** | Marine text, marine text summaries |

## Swedish / Norwegian (nav & marketing)

| SV | NB |
|----|-----|
| Regnradar | Regnradar |
| Havsväder | Havsvær |

Internal code names (`StormRadar`, `marine_text_*` keys) may stay unchanged unless refactoring.
